+-------------------------------------------------------
+<a name="runningTasks"></a>
+### queue.runningTasks()
+
+Returns a new array containing the values of tasks whose workers have started and have not
+completed. Values are returned in worker start order, including duplicates and `undefined`.
+Queued or paused tasks are excluded until their workers start.
+
